            <ArticleTitle>Apoptosis: understanding the new molecular pathway.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>371-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Advances in science have increased the knowledge of how cells die in the body (apoptosis). A basic understanding of this process can improve nurses' ability to review new scientific literature and enable them to provide safer bedside care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
